{
 "source": "Falloutak's sound catalogue (Marek 11-19: every player, NPC and environment action has a sound; Fallout 2's if possible). key = the event; mc = Minecraft's own sound (always available); f2 = the Fallout 2 files (sound\\SFX\\*.ACM in the player's OWN master.dat) that tools/fallout2_sounds.py turns into the private pack 'falloutak_f2'; none = the F2 pack plays the Minecraft sound. The F2 names follow the engine (fallout2-ce game_sound.cc): W + R ready (= reload) / A attack / O out of ammo / F flying / H hit + the weapon's sound code (10mm pistol A, 10mm SMG D, knife 3, flare 4, frag grenade O) + 1 primary / 2 secondary + the material hit (F flesh, S stone, M metal, W wood); HMXXXX/HFXXXX = a man / a woman: AO hit from the front, AP from behind, BA/BB fall back/front, YA/YB pass out, ZA/ZB die. A first pass by name, for Marek's ear.",
